## Generator table (verified by SymPy)

```
P = [[0,1],[0,0]]              translation
D = [[1/2,0],[0,-1/2]]         dilation
K = [[0,0],[1,0]]              special conformal
```

Commutation:
```
[P, K] = 2·D    [D, P] = P    [D, K] = -K
